    dct:source "Expert group indicator compilation, 8 September 2025 (free-text disaggregation column)"@en ;
    skos:editorialNote "Keep as a territorial dimension or attribute and move to Geography. Definition and use must respect community custodianship and national context. Reference: UNDRIP Article 26; expert samples 9d07 and 9d09. Supporting rights context, not a ready made codelist. (moved to Geographic per domain review)"@en ;
